Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:09:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD route selected-agent slash commands through backend
 execution

Selected agent chat messages that are slash commands use the provider command path so Codex resumes receive the raw command instead of prompt-wrapped chat text. The provider trait keeps this backward compatible with a default unsupported-command reply for backends that do not implement native command execution.
